02:20:13.220 --> 02:20:18.700
20AE is a resolution authorizing the mayor to enter into a special employment

02:20:18.980 --> 02:20:21.620
employee agreement between the city of Huntsville and David J.

02:20:21.710 --> 02:20:22.370
Williams.

02:20:22.700 --> 02:20:23.940
Move to approve the resolution.

02:20:24.180 --> 02:20:25.460
Moved by motion by Ms.

02:20:25.500 --> 02:20:27.060
Ryan, seconded by Mr.

02:20:27.340 --> 02:20:29.090
Meredith, I believe, beat him to the punch.

02:20:29.540 --> 02:20:30.660
Thank you, council members.

02:20:30.750 --> 02:20:32.980
Kelly Scrimpshaw, director of communication.

02:20:33.410 --> 02:20:37.960
So the contract before you is a special employee agreement with between

02:20:37.970 --> 02:20:42.690
the city and David Williams for a senior communication specialist.

02:20:42.970 --> 02:20:46.120
Um, some of you may be aware this is a very important,

02:20:46.370 --> 02:20:50.570
uh, leadership and operational management position in our department that's

02:20:50.570 --> 02:20:52.740
been vacant for about 2 years.

02:20:53.150 --> 02:20:56.000
During a recent recruitment process, however,

02:20:56.290 --> 02:20:59.890
we, uh, David Williams applied and we were able to interview him.

02:21:00.330 --> 02:21:03.770
And we were very, very impressed with his leadership skills,

02:21:03.850 --> 02:21:09.610
his 29 years, his depth of experience in news operations and management

02:21:09.810 --> 02:21:14.110
and civic engagement, um, as we evaluated his,

02:21:14.120 --> 02:21:19.170
um, his qualifications, we really, he checked a lot of boxes for this senior

02:21:19.170 --> 02:21:20.610
communication position.

02:21:21.210 --> 02:21:25.930
So we spoke with management and we decided in this particular case the most

02:21:25.930 --> 02:21:30.850
appropriate approach would be to make this a contract position.

02:21:30.970 --> 02:21:34.360
So this is a funded one year contract position.

02:21:34.570 --> 02:21:37.640
It gives us both time to evaluate each other,

02:21:37.810 --> 02:21:41.450
make sure that this is going to be a good fit for the administration.

02:21:41.610 --> 02:21:45.570
Of course he'll be supporting city council as well and all of the departments.

02:21:45.900 --> 02:21:47.900
And we're asking for your consideration.

02:21:50.620 --> 02:21:51.700
Uh, thank you, Ms.

02:21:51.820 --> 02:21:52.910
uh, Scrimture.

02:21:53.020 --> 02:21:54.700
Any discussion, Mr.

02:21:54.820 --> 02:21:55.300
Meredith?

02:21:55.400 --> 02:21:56.620
Yes, um.

02:21:57.620 --> 02:22:04.540
I pulled this one because on the heels of the administrative reorganization

02:22:04.540 --> 02:22:13.930
and the lack of um Um, competition, uh, for the jobs in the reorganization.

02:22:14.950 --> 02:22:20.990
On the heels of the Wellstone project, um,

02:22:22.890 --> 02:22:29.300
That we Still gives me heartburn, um, the $3 million that we have given

02:22:29.300 --> 02:22:32.260
them when they only asked for 1.4 million.

02:22:33.190 --> 02:22:39.110
And that was also something that was not a competition or there was no RFP

02:22:39.110 --> 02:22:43.790
or other uh public mental health providers.

02:22:44.920 --> 02:22:50.210
Had did not have the opportunity to even compete for and frankly I think

02:22:50.420 --> 02:22:55.660
the better option would have been to put those beds at Crestwood Crest View.

02:22:56.580 --> 02:23:02.940
Hospital, um, rather than them spend all the money building 16 bed facility.

02:23:05.410 --> 02:23:13.690
But with those two things and Uh The reorganization had transparency.

02:23:14.010 --> 02:23:17.530
I didn't like how it happened, but it was transparent.

02:23:17.850 --> 02:23:20.170
But the Wellstone project was not transparent.

02:23:20.880 --> 02:23:22.730
And neither is this.

02:23:22.960 --> 02:23:27.040
Now, this has nothing to do with the qualifications of Mr.

02:23:27.150 --> 02:23:27.770
Williams.

02:23:28.040 --> 02:23:29.360
I think he's a fine candidate.

02:23:29.400 --> 02:23:32.320
I think he is very qualified for this position.

02:23:32.680 --> 02:23:35.840
My opposition has nothing to do with the man himself.

02:23:36.160 --> 02:23:43.200
It has to do with, here's another almost $90,000 job that other folks would

02:23:43.200 --> 02:23:46.910
have died for the opportunity to apply for.

02:23:47.380 --> 02:23:52.940
And we have once again not allowed the citizens of of of Huntsville and

02:23:52.940 --> 02:23:58.620
surrounding areas the opportunity to compete for a well paying job here

02:23:58.620 --> 02:24:03.300
in the city, let alone city employees that would have liked to have applied

02:24:03.300 --> 02:24:08.170
for this job, and it just, it just doesn't sit right.

02:24:08.710 --> 02:24:15.470
That we are giving very good paying jobs to people who don't have to compete

02:24:15.470 --> 02:24:18.460
for them and that just gives me heartburn,

02:24:18.750 --> 02:24:20.110
um, again.

02:24:20.970 --> 02:24:26.650
I think this should be a merit-based job that was open to the public or

02:24:26.650 --> 02:24:28.590
at least uh limited.

02:24:28.780 --> 02:24:31.840
I know sometimes we offer jobs limited to city employees,

02:24:32.010 --> 02:24:36.650
at least that, but it shouldn't just be, I saw this guy's resume,

02:24:36.770 --> 02:24:39.010
I liked it, I wanna give him a job.

02:24:39.280 --> 02:24:45.570
And it's again, almost $90,000 plus benefits and folks.

02:24:45.700 --> 02:24:49.880
A lot of folks, particularly right now, would love to have the opportunity

02:24:49.890 --> 02:24:52.280
to have competed for that, um.

02:24:54.340 --> 02:24:58.100
I don't really, I don't have a problem with special employment agreements.

02:24:58.300 --> 02:25:02.700
I'm very used to seeing them as part-time retiree filled spots,

02:25:02.940 --> 02:25:07.940
which I don't have a problem with it not being competed for because they

02:25:07.940 --> 02:25:10.530
in many cases like one further down on this,

02:25:10.740 --> 02:25:13.400
uh, agenda, it's someone that's renewing,

02:25:13.820 --> 02:25:15.860
so it, it's not.

02:25:17.070 --> 02:25:19.610
It's not the fact it's a special employment agreement,

02:25:19.620 --> 02:25:25.870
it's not the fact that it is, um, uh, a person that in my view is unqualified

02:25:25.870 --> 02:25:27.660
because he's very much qualified.

02:25:27.880 --> 02:25:32.950
It's the fact that we did not give others the opportunity to compete for

02:25:32.950 --> 02:25:33.630
this job.

02:25:33.950 --> 02:25:37.790
That's my issue with it and and you and you've explained it well.

02:25:37.870 --> 02:25:39.420
I, I, I, I, I don't.

02:25:40.450 --> 02:25:41.520
I don't have any.

02:25:41.770 --> 02:25:44.730
I don't think you're going around sneaking around kind of thing.

02:25:44.930 --> 02:25:49.370
It just strikes me as wrong not to allow others the opportunity.

02:25:49.460 --> 02:25:52.610
Well, council member Meredith, you do bring up an excellent point,

02:25:52.690 --> 02:25:54.930
and I do understand this position.

02:25:55.170 --> 02:25:58.850
It's really the one reason we're asking for a contract.

02:25:59.130 --> 02:26:02.570
Um, the recruitment process previously where we interviewed Mr.

02:26:02.730 --> 02:26:03.410
Williams was.

02:26:03.610 --> 02:26:05.530
An open recruitment process.

02:26:05.930 --> 02:26:09.760
I've done a lot of interviews for the years and when you meet the right

02:26:09.760 --> 02:26:15.370
candidate that checks some very specific qualifications that are not widely

02:26:15.370 --> 02:26:20.120
available in the public, you recognize that this is an opportunity and we

02:26:20.170 --> 02:26:24.890
did want to take, take, to move on this opportunity and in a prudent and

02:26:24.890 --> 02:26:26.580
respectful and responsible way.

02:26:26.870 --> 02:26:29.290
Which is this is a 1 year contract.

02:26:29.610 --> 02:26:32.740
At the end of this year we will have two options.

02:26:33.010 --> 02:26:39.680
We can either decide at council's approval to renew the contract or to make

02:26:39.680 --> 02:26:39.850
Mr.

02:26:40.010 --> 02:26:44.570
Williams a merit employee, which at that time we would need to open the

02:26:44.570 --> 02:26:48.970
position to the public and members of the public could apply as well as

02:26:48.970 --> 02:26:49.130
Mr.

02:26:49.290 --> 02:26:49.850
Williams.

02:26:50.880 --> 02:26:51.850
Thank you very much, Ms.

