02:33:20.200 --> 02:33:23.910
I'm here specifically to address the mayor regarding the issue we've been

02:33:23.910 --> 02:33:25.320
facing in Providence.

02:33:25.600 --> 02:33:28.810
Mayor Battle, I believe that resolving this matter rests in your hands,

02:33:28.840 --> 02:33:30.750
and only you can help us at this point.

02:33:31.330 --> 02:33:34.290
We have been in desperate need of a second entrance for years in the newer

02:33:34.290 --> 02:33:35.480
part of Providence.

02:33:35.930 --> 02:33:39.920
Navigating our entrance in is a constant battle and a stressful nightmare.

02:33:40.330 --> 02:33:43.820
Traffic backs up constantly as there are delivery trucks that block the

02:33:43.820 --> 02:33:46.040
streets on an almost daily basis.

02:33:46.530 --> 02:33:49.130
The streets are very narrow, short, and windy.

02:33:50.110 --> 02:33:54.070
You have many blind spots and it's very pedestrian heavy with pedestrians

02:33:54.070 --> 02:33:56.710
not following rules and constantly jaywalking.

