02:41:23.740 --> 02:41:27.880
I want to begin by reminding this body of the very foundation of Huntsville's

02:41:27.880 --> 02:41:29.200
noise ordinance.

02:41:29.480 --> 02:41:34.560
It opens with a clear declaration of policy that every resident of the city

02:41:34.560 --> 02:41:39.390
deserves to live peacefully, protected from excessive disturbing noises

02:41:39.560 --> 02:41:41.840
that jeopardize their health, tranquility,

02:41:42.160 --> 02:41:44.250
and the quiet enjoyment of their property.

02:41:44.660 --> 02:41:49.170
